Z||000013||87ECO5||12-18-2000||08:51 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by FieroSTETZ:<BR><B>did anyone notice it said geo metro turbo? was i seeing that right, is that real???</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I think Chevy (actually Suzuki) produced a small car in the late '80's called the Chevy Sprint Turbo.  I also think it was a 3 cylinder engine with a VERY small turbocharger and intercooler bolted to it.<P>Don't know anything else about it.||||reg||1
Z||000014||william_thorniii||12-18-2000||09:08 AM||||EC05,<P>I actually witnessed a Sprint turbo beat a 302 Mustang up at Buick City Raceway in Flint.  It is a 1/2 mile oval.  The Mustang had him off of the first straight, but couldn't cut to the inside.  The Sprint ended up winning  by a couple of lengths.  <P>William T. Thorn, III||||reg||14
